{%- comment -%}
  Geom is self-hosted (assets/geom-variable.woff2) and is the theme's default
  typeface for body, subheading, heading and accent — see 'theme-styles-variables'.
  Because it is one variable font covering wght 300–900, a single preload replaces
  the four picker-driven preloads this snippet used to emit.

  Italic (assets/geom-italic-variable.woff2) is deliberately not preloaded: it is
  used rarely enough that fetching it up front costs more than it saves.
{%- endcomment -%}
